{"strongs": "H1160", "word": "בְּעוֺר", "translit": "be.or", "root": "בעור", "morph": "N:N-M-P", "pos": "proper name, masculine", "gloss": "a burning", "definition": "בְּעוֺר proper name, masculine ( a burning ; ᵑ7 torch ) — 1. father of Balaam Num 22:5 ; Num 31:8 ; Deut 23:5 ; Josh 13:22 ; Josh 24:9 ; Mic 6:5 בְּעֹר Num 24:3 ; Num 24:15 ( ׳ בנו ב ). 2. father of בֶּלַע , a king of Edom Gen 36:32 = 1Chr 1:43 .", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB1244')\">BDB1244</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H1160')\">H1160</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB1243')\">BDB1243</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB1245')\">BDB1245</entry></div><p> <bdbheb>בְּעוֺר</bdbheb> <b>proper name, masculine</b> (<highlight>a burning</highlight>; <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Tg')\"><bdbheb><reflink>ᵑ7</reflink></bdbheb></lookup> <highlight>torch</highlight>) — <div class=\"point\"><b>1.</b> father of Balaam <ref ref=\"Num 22:5\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"22\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"22\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(4,22,5)\">Num 22:5</ref>; <ref ref=\"Num 31:8\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"31\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"31\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(4,31,8)\">Num 31:8</ref>; <ref ref=\"Deut 23:5\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"23\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"23\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(5,23,5)\">Deut 23:5</ref>; <ref ref=\"Josh 13:22\" b=\"6\" cBegin=\"13\" vBegin=\"22\" cEnd=\"13\" vEnd=\"22\" onclick=\"bcv(6,13,22)\">Josh 13:22</ref>; <ref ref=\"Josh 24:9\" b=\"6\" cBegin=\"24\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"24\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(6,24,9)\">Josh 24:9</ref>; <ref ref=\"Mic 6:5\" b=\"33\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(33,6,5)\">Mic 6:5</ref> <bdbheb>בְּעֹר</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Num 24:3\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"24\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"24\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(4,24,3)\">Num 24:3</ref>; <ref ref=\"Num 24:15\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"24\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"24\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(4,24,15)\">Num 24:15</ref> (<bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>בנו ב</bdbheb>). </div><d